WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.731
- [Female Narrator] What is Synesthesia?

00:00:01.731 --> 00:00:04.908
Everybody who has it experiences
it in different ways,

00:00:04.908 --> 00:00:07.441
so I asked a handful of
people from around the world

00:00:07.441 --> 00:00:08.698
about their experience.

00:00:08.698 --> 00:00:09.938
- [Male Respondent] Somewhere in my brain,

00:00:09.938 --> 00:00:11.948
the senses get mixed together.

00:00:11.948 --> 00:00:14.570
When I experience one, I'm
also experiencing another

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.380
that is completely unrelated.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.519
- [Female Narrator] What do you mean?

00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:20.228
- [Male Respondent] I color
code numbers in my head.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:21.639
- [Female Respondent]
So, ever since I was a child,

00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:24.108
I was able to taste words.

00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:25.915
- [Female Participant]
If I'm in physical pain,

00:00:25.915 --> 00:00:28.976
I experience the pain in color and shape.

00:00:28.976 --> 00:00:31.085
- [Female Interviewee] Sounds,
melodies, and, in fact,

00:00:31.085 --> 00:00:34.453
soundtracks also has a color to me.

00:00:34.453 --> 00:00:36.264
- [Female Narrator] What
sort of associations

00:00:36.264 --> 00:00:37.382
would you make?

00:00:37.382 --> 00:00:39.502
- [Female Participator]
The number three is blue.

00:00:39.502 --> 00:00:40.864
- [Female Respondent]
Number three is light blue.

00:00:40.864 --> 00:00:42.134
- [Male Respondent] Three is yellow.

00:00:42.134 --> 00:00:45.077
- [Female Interviewee]
Number six is a flirty woman.

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:46.227
- [Male Respondent] Four
is green, two is red.

00:00:46.227 --> 00:00:47.853
42 is green-red.

00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:50.061
That's my favorite number, because I like

00:00:50.061 --> 00:00:51.773
the colors red and green together.

00:00:51.773 --> 00:00:53.904
- [Female Narrator] But
wait, it gets weirder.

00:00:53.904 --> 00:00:54.737
- [Female Interviewee] For example,

00:00:54.737 --> 00:00:56.883
I loved Flashdance songs.

00:00:56.883 --> 00:00:59.293
She's a Maniac is blue one for me,

00:00:59.293 --> 00:01:01.710
but What a Feeling is yellow.

00:01:03.205 --> 00:01:06.863
- [Female Respondent] Word
people tastes like meatballs

00:01:06.863 --> 00:01:08.085
in tomato sauce.

00:01:08.085 --> 00:01:10.396
- [Female Contributor] Violins
as navy blue rectangles

00:01:10.396 --> 00:01:12.178
moving from right to left.

00:01:12.178 --> 00:01:14.685
- [Female Respondent] The
word English tastes like

00:01:14.685 --> 00:01:15.988
a slice of lemon.

00:01:15.988 --> 00:01:18.448
The sound of banjos tastes like Oreos.

00:01:18.448 --> 00:01:19.479
- [Female Narrator] Crazy, right?

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:20.889
But a life without it?

00:01:20.889 --> 00:01:23.348
- [Female Interviewee] Hmm,
my life without Synthesia

00:01:23.348 --> 00:01:24.959
I don't want to imagine it.

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:25.792
More empty.

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:26.836
- [Female Participator] My
life would be a lot more bland.

00:01:26.836 --> 00:01:28.538
- [Female Contributor] The
world would be very flat

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:29.828
and not as colorful.

00:01:29.828 --> 00:01:32.911
- [Male Respondent] I would be bored.

